# Generated assets. Their formatting is whatever the generator emits, so
# Prettier must not own it — otherwise regenerating (e.g.
# `python scripts/gen-transmarvel-tables.py --pool-only`) silently breaks
# `npm run format-check` in CI.
#
# Note CI's format-check checks JSON under src/ too: the `--ext js,jsx,ts,tsx`
# in the npm script is not a real Prettier flag and is ignored.
src/assets/transmarvel-pool.json
# JSON.stringify keeps `masterLevelCap`'s 51 numbers one per line; Prettier
# wants them packed. Regenerating must not need a format pass to stay green.
